exports[`EN: itiraz metni > tam metin 1`] = `
{
  "body": "Dear FedEx Billing Team,

On behalf of Demo Export (account 123456789), we have reviewed invoice 9-482-11735 dated Oct 27, 2026 against the dimensions and weights we recorded at packing time and our contracted tariff. We identified overcharges on the following 3 shipments:

1) Tracking number 794812345305 (Oct 22, 2026) — Dimension discrepancy
   Our measurement: 40 x 30.5 x 25 cm, 4.0 kg, chargeable 6.0 kg
   Billed: 45 x 35 x 30 cm, 4.5 kg, chargeable 9.5 kg
   Expected amount: 1,184.00 TRY · Billed amount: 1,642.50 TRY (excl. VAT)
   Requested correction: 458.50 TRY

2) Tracking number 794812345288 — Duplicate billing
   This shipment has already been billed. Billed: 1,120.00 TRY (excl. VAT)
   Requested correction: 1,120.00 TRY (full cancellation)

3) Tracking number 794812345293 — Surcharge, Weight discrepancy
   Our measurement: chargeable 4.5 kg
   Billed: chargeable 1,250.0 kg
   Surcharges: Address Correction 412.00 TRY, PEAK 12.50 TRY
   Expected amount: — · Billed amount: 1,377.84 TRY (excl. VAT)
   Requested correction: 412.00 TRY

Total requested correction: 1,990.50 TRY (excl. VAT)

Photos of our measurements are available on request. We kindly ask you to issue a credit note for the amounts above.

Kind regards,
Elif Kaya
Demo Export
Email: elif@demo.com
Phone: +90 212 000 00 00",
  "lineCount": 3,
  "photoCount": 0,
  "subject": "Invoice dispute — FedEx 9-482-11735 (3 shipments, 1,990.50 TRY)",
  "total": 1990.5,
}
`;

